      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp prevent scratches during loading and unloading?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp features low‑speed, sensor‑controlled descent and ascent, eliminating sudden jolts. Anti‑slip rubber surfaces and adjustable height ensure the bike’s wheels stay aligned, while cushioned rollers absorb impact. This combination guarantees a scratch‑free experience, even for high‑value motorcycles.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike parcel in real time while it travels the 850 km route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our GPS-enabled containers provide live location updates every 5‑10 minutes via a secure portal. You’ll receive a unique tracking link that shows the current position, estimated arrival, and any transit alerts, giving you full visibility from Chakeri to the destination hub.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with the bike transportation service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, covering loss, theft, and accidental damage during transit. The policy is automatically activated upon booking, and a detailed insurance certificate is issued with the GST invoice for easy claim processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is bike parcel service available for scooters and electric two‑wheelers in Chakeri?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our specialized two‑wheeler fleet accommodates standard motorcycles, scooters, and electric bikes. The same hydraulic ramp and 4‑layer packing are used, with additional battery safety checks for electric models to comply with transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are the costs calculated for bike transportation from Chakeri to other major cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on a transparent matrix: base fare, distance‑based surcharge (per km), optional premium packing, and insurance premium (percentage of declared value). No hidden fees are added; the final quote is provided upfront after we confirm bike dimensions and destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide for a smooth bike parcel booking?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original RC, a copy of your ID proof, the insurance certificate (if you have personal coverage), and a GST invoice for corporate or government moves. Our team also prepares the e‑Way bill, which requires the RC and destination address.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
